Infravision grants the ability to see heat sources in the dark to a creature.
Note that this means that they can detect the presence of creatures, but
determining what the creature actually is may be somewhat difficult.  Items
typically have no internal heat sources, so are undetectable via infravision.

Infravision is a passive enhancement granted by mage sight if your skill
is high enough. It can also be found independently on some potions and
scrolls throughout the realm.

See also: MAGE SIGHT
